      "html": "<h3>What is an IT asset audit app?</h3><p>A tool for checking IT hardware on site. You confirm each device exists, photograph its serial and asset tag, and match the count to the asset register or CMDB. Quickler does it in WhatsApp. No new app to install.</p><h3>How does an asset audit match the CMDB?</h3><p>You record what is really there. Then you compare it with the register. The result is a gap list: ghost assets with no device, and found devices with no record.</p><h3>Does an IT asset audit help with ISO 27001?</h3><p>It can. Annex A treats asset management and secure disposal as controls. A photographed, timed inventory is useful proof. The audit does not certify you. A competent person and your certification body decide.</p><h3>Can I run an asset audit in WhatsApp?</h3><p>Yes. Each question arrives in your chat. You reply by text, voice note or a photo of the serial plate. When you say done, Quickler writes the report. No new app. No login.</p><h3>Related guides</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/data-centre-audit-software-uk.html\">Data centre audit software</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/cctv-access-control-inspection-uk.html\">CCTV and access control inspection</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/iso-27001-physical-security-audit-uk.html\">ISO 27001 physical security audit</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/comms-room-inspection-checklist-uk.html\">Comms room inspection checklist</a></li></ul>"
